# Two UIs
The page users actually get is templates/index.html, served by Flask. frontend/ is a Vite/React app copied into the image as static files. Change the surface you were asked to change. Do not port one into the other in passing.

# Untrusted scan data
- Findings, paths, snippets, and tool output are text. Do not assign them to innerHTML or dangerouslySetInnerHTML.
- Links from scan data must not be javascript: or data: URLs.
- Do not put secrets in VITE_ variables. The session cookie is HttpOnly. The browser sends X-CSRF-Token. It does not read the access token.
- Client-side role checks are only for hiding buttons. The API still enforces access.
